<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="container my-5 py-3" style="max-width: 850px;">
  <div class="text-center mb-5">
    <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-danger-subtle text-danger rounded-circle mb-3" style="width: 64px; height: 64px;">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-house-user fa-2x"></i>
    </div>
    <h1 class="fw-bold text-dark display-6">Host Guidelines & Standards</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Essentials for providing safe, welcoming, and memorable stays on Wanderlust.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 p-4 mb-4">
    <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3 text-dark"><i class="fa-solid fa-square-check text-danger me-2"></i> 1. Accurate Listing Details</h4>
    <p class="text-secondary lh-lg mb-0">
      Always provide realistic high-quality photos, honest descriptions of amenities, accurate property location, and clear pricing to set transparent expectations for your guests.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 p-4 mb-4">
    <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3 text-dark"><i class="fa-solid fa-broom text-danger me-2"></i> 2. Cleanliness & Hygiene</h4>
    <p class="text-secondary lh-lg mb-0">
      Maintain strict cleanliness protocols across bedrooms, bathrooms, and kitchen areas before each guest check-in to ensure a comfortable stay.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 p-4 mb-4">
    <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3 text-dark"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-danger me-2"></i> 3. Safety & Responsiveness</h4>
    <p class="text-secondary lh-lg mb-0">
      Equip your space with essential safety amenities (first aid kit, smoke detectors) and maintain prompt communication during guest check-ins and inquiries.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="text-center mt-4">
    <a href="/listings/new" class="btn btn-dark rounded-pill px-4 py-2.5 fw-bold">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-plus-circle me-2"></i> Start Hosting Now
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
